        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes on the exam... Study the environment, answer the questions before time runs out, find secrets in the classroom and don't even think about looking directly at that... thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your score in every game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover dark secrets hidden in the classroom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a 100% diegetic horror experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up at your desk in a dreary classroom run by a monstrous teacher. Your goal is to correctly answer as many questions as possible on the exam in front of you. How can you know the answers? Look around you, look at your classmates' exams, strain your eyes and study your surroundings... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199430/extras/a64baa2c1788cc5b32a1e9cf3a6b12f4.poster.avif?t=1773492592\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199430/extras/a64baa2c1788cc5b32a1e9cf3a6b12f4.webm?t=1773492592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199430/extras/a64baa2c1788cc5b32a1e9cf3a6b12f4.mp4?t=1773492592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, don't let the teacher catch you with your eyes off the exam or failing will be the least of your problems....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199430/extras/181705e39ccb6a6bff1e615d751ca3ed.poster.avif?t=1773492592\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199430/extras/181705e39ccb6a6bff1e615d751ca3ed.webm?t=1773492592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199430/extras/181705e39ccb6a6bff1e615d751ca3ed.mp4?t=1773492592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes on the exam... Study the environment, answer the questions before time runs out, find secrets in the classroom and don't even think about looking directly at that... thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your score in every game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover dark secrets hidden in the classroom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a 100% diegetic horror experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up at your desk in a dreary classroom run by a monstrous teacher. Your goal is to correctly answer as many questions as possible on the exam in front of you. How can you know the answers? Look around you, look at your classmates' exams, strain your eyes and study your surroundings... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199430/extras/a64baa2c1788cc5b32a1e9cf3a6b12f4.poster.avif?t=1773492592\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199430/extras/a64baa2c1788cc5b32a1e9cf3a6b12f4.webm?t=1773492592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199430/extras/a64baa2c1788cc5b32a1e9cf3a6b12f4.mp4?t=1773492592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, don't let the teacher catch you with your eyes off the exam or failing will be the least of your problems....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199430/extras/181705e39ccb6a6bff1e615d751ca3ed.poster.avif?t=1773492592\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199430/extras/181705e39ccb6a6bff1e615d751ca3ed.webm?t=1773492592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3199430/extras/181705e39ccb6a6bff1e615d751ca3ed.mp4?t=1773492592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
